          <div class="future-point"><strong>Keep the judgment</strong>Product thinking, architecture, and domain expertise make output useful.</div>
          <div class="future-point"><strong>Verify the result</strong>Testing, review, observability, reliability, and security are non-negotiable.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
